# Trivy vulnerability suppressions
#
# Add CVE IDs here to suppress known/accepted vulnerabilities that have been
# reviewed and accepted. Always include a comment explaining the rationale.
#
# Format:
#   CVE-YYYY-NNNNN  # <reason> — reviewed by <name> on <date>
#
# Example:
#   CVE-2024-12345  # No fix available; not exploitable in our threat model — reviewed by piers on 2026-01-01
